n></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">获取飞行记录的本地存储路径。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span></code></span></td><td>返回飞行记录的本地存储路径。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iflightlogmanager_getflyclogpath\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iflightlogmanager_getflyclogpath_inline\">getFlyClogPath</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iflightlogmanager_getflyclogpath_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getFlyClogPath</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getFlyClogPath</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">获取飞控精简日志的本地存储路径。 <br></font></p><div class=\"ifm-callout\"><font color=\"#666\"><strong>注意</strong><br><br> 在使用过程中如果更换了遥控器或者重装了App，需要重启飞行器才能产生飞控精简日志。</font></div><p></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span></code></span></td><td>返回飞控精简日志的本地存储路径。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n\n        </font></font></font></div><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\">\n      </font></font></font>","tocHtml":"\n        <div class=\"site-toc-inner\">\n          <div class=\"site-toc-title\">本页目录</div>\n          <ul data-static-toc=\"true\" class=\"site-toc-list\"><li><a href=\"#ifm-overview\" data-target=\"ifm-overview\">概览</a></li><li><a href=\"#类成员\" data-target=\"ifm-members-nav\">成员索引</a></li><li class=\"toc-group\"><span class=\"toc-group-title\">方法</span></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#iflightlogmanager_getflightrecordpath\" data-target=\"iflightlogmanager_getflightrecordpath\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>getFlightRecordPath</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#iflightlogmanager_getflyclogpath\" data-target=\"iflightlogmanager_getflyclogpath\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>getFlyClogPath</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      ","buildId":"1795062244970"}